{"id":50957,"date":"2026-05-02T06:55:17","date_gmt":"2026-05-02T05:55:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50957"},"modified":"2026-08-21T15:59:00","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T14:59:00","slug":"lidl-sao-silvestre-lisboa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lidl-sao-silvestre-lisboa\/","title":{"rendered":"Lidl S\u00e3o Silvestre Lisboa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO LIDL S\u00c3O SILVESTRE DE LISBOA 2026 --><\/p>\n<p><!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">LIDL S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lisboa 2026<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A 19.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da LIDL S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lisboa realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 26 de dezembro de 2026 com partida e chegada na ic\u00f3nica Avenida da Liberdade, em Lisboa. Organizada pela HMS Sports, \u00e9 a prova noturna de 10 km mais concorrida da capital, famosa pelo duelo de elites &#8220;Homens vs Mulheres&#8221;. Otimiza o teu tempo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calculadora de pace<\/a> e explora a lista de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-lisboa\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas em Lisboa<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas 10km<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>26 de dezembro de 2026 (21h30 Noturno)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Avenida da Liberdade, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>10 km (Corrida Principal Noturna)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Asfalto Urbano, Cais do Sodr\u00e9, Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio e Av. Liberdade<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/>\n  <\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O circuito de 10 km desce a Avenida da Liberdade, passa pelo Rossio, Cais do Sodr\u00e9 e Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio antes de subir os metros finais da Av. da Liberdade sob ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o de Natal.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 4. BANNER CALCULADORA --><\/p>\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !